        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/8f328871e2dfb547fa10c204eac94e2f.webp?t=1780865290\" width=597 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/d6bd1308bf2daa3a145747ec968a0ef5.poster.avif?t=1780865290\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/d6bd1308bf2daa3a145747ec968a0ef5.webm?t=1780865290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/d6bd1308bf2daa3a145747ec968a0ef5.mp4?t=1780865290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short choice-driven roguelike RPG, set in the desert. You're a line man that's stolen the company truck, in search of enlightenment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your truck to explore, roll your dice, and get into trouble. Consider it a simple CRPG 1-pager: For short, two-hour playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/72d5fc00eba4f052fe39b9ffabb027b9.webp?t=1780865290\" width=597 height=51 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick your stats, including your ace skill, then level them up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65+ Encounters: Day and Night bring out different vagrants, monsters, and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in deadly shootouts, knife fights, and nail-biting diceroll encounters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a daily journal to affect the game and reach <strong>your own </strong>enlightenment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazy, hand-drawn pixel art guides your desert journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Discoveries: Complete an array of different discoveries across nonlinear playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete many different endings with an array of secrets, stories, and characters across an array of playstyles!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/f6653f10734b09ae9d99e3404652d050.poster.avif?t=1780865290\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/f6653f10734b09ae9d99e3404652d050.webm?t=1780865290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/f6653f10734b09ae9d99e3404652d050.mp4?t=1780865290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real trips to the Mojave.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/8f328871e2dfb547fa10c204eac94e2f.webp?t=1780865290\" width=597 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/d6bd1308bf2daa3a145747ec968a0ef5.poster.avif?t=1780865290\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/d6bd1308bf2daa3a145747ec968a0ef5.webm?t=1780865290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/d6bd1308bf2daa3a145747ec968a0ef5.mp4?t=1780865290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short choice-driven roguelike RPG, set in the desert. You're a line man that's stolen the company truck, in search of enlightenment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your truck to explore, roll your dice, and get into trouble. Consider it a simple CRPG 1-pager: For short, two-hour playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/72d5fc00eba4f052fe39b9ffabb027b9.webp?t=1780865290\" width=597 height=51 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick your stats, including your ace skill, then level them up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65+ Encounters: Day and Night bring out different vagrants, monsters, and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in deadly shootouts, knife fights, and nail-biting diceroll encounters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a daily journal to affect the game and reach <strong>your own </strong>enlightenment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazy, hand-drawn pixel art guides your desert journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Discoveries: Complete an array of different discoveries across nonlinear playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete many different endings with an array of secrets, stories, and characters across an array of playstyles!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/f6653f10734b09ae9d99e3404652d050.poster.avif?t=1780865290\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/f6653f10734b09ae9d99e3404652d050.webm?t=1780865290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432490/extras/f6653f10734b09ae9d99e3404652d050.mp4?t=1780865290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real trips to the Mojave.</p>",
